# The Dungeon Gatekeeper of Rune castle (35506), out of a siege: the character, whose clan is
# registered to attack Rune castle (8) before its siege starts, talks to it: it greets with its page
# (onFirstTalk); the page's link (onTalk) finds the castle's siege not fought and sends the
# character into Benom's dungeon: the teleport aborts what the character was doing (five
# ActionFailed) and lands it there, and the link's empty answer releases the client. Expectations are derived from the reference source
# (DungeonTeleporter.java 38-55).
character Hunter 20
clan 5
siege 8 attacker
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.benom.DungeonTeleporter
page doormen/35506.htm
npc gatekeeper 35506 CastleDoorman 60 0 0

action gatekeeper
action gatekeeper
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gatekeeper item=0 page=doormen/35506.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{gatekeeper}_Quest DungeonTeleporter
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=12589,-49044,-3008 fast=0
  S ActionFailed
